Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mediatek: connect SCP to shared MT6878 infracfg

Use the existing syscon also used by power domains; do not instantiate the
vendor's competing infracfg platform driver or duplicate its MMIO resource.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6878-scp-manual.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6878-scp-manual.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6878-scp-manual.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6878-scp-manual.dtsi
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@
 
 	scp: remoteproc@1c400000 {
 		compatible = "mediatek,scp";
+		mediatek,infracfg = <&infracfg_ao>;
 		reg = <0x1c400000 0x100000>,
 		      <0x1cb24000 0x1000>,
 		      <0x1cb21000 0x1000>,
